{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0035-search-insert-position","title":"LeetCode 35 搜索插入位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0035-search-insert-position","wordCount":677,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-35-搜索插入位置\">LeetCode 35 搜索插入位置</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个排序数组和一个目标值，在数组中找到目标值，并返回其索引。如果目标值不存在于数组中，返回它将会被按顺序插入的位置。</p>\n<p>请必须使用时间复杂度为 O(log n) 的算法。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>-10⁴ &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>nums</code> 为无重复元素的升序排列数组</li>\n<li><code>-10⁴ &lt;= target &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 5&#10;输出：2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 2&#10;输出：1&#10;解释：2 应插入到索引 1 的位置（在 1 和 3 之间）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：2 应插入到索引 1 的位置（在 1 和 3 之间）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 7&#10;输出：4&#10;解释：7 应插入到数组末尾\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：7 应插入到数组末尾</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 4：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 0&#10;输出：0&#10;解释：0 应插入到数组开头\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：0 应插入到数组开头</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>题目明确要求 O(log n) 的时间复杂度，这就是在告诉我们使用<strong>二分查找</strong>。本题实际上是二分查找的一个经典变体——<strong>查找第一个大于等于目标值的位置</strong>（即下界 lower bound）。</p>\n<p>标准二分查找在找到目标时直接返回索引，在未找到时返回 -1。而本题需要我们在未找到时返回&quot;应该插入的位置&quot;。仔细分析可以发现：无论目标值是否存在于数组中，我们要找的都是<strong>数组中第一个 ≥ target 的元素的位置</strong>。</p>\n<p>二分查找的关键在于<strong>循环不变量的维护</strong>。我们采用左闭右闭区间 <code>[left, right]</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始化 <code>left = 0</code>，<code>right = nums.length - 1</code></li>\n<li>当 <code>left &lt;= right</code> 时循环</li>\n<li>计算中间位置 <code>mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2)</code>（防止整数溢出）</li>\n<li>若 <code>nums[mid] === target</code>，直接返回 <code>mid</code></li>\n<li>若 <code>nums[mid] &lt; target</code>，目标在右半区间，<code>left = mid + 1</code></li>\n<li>若 <code>nums[mid] &gt; target</code>，目标在左半区间，<code>right = mid - 1</code></li>\n<li>循环结束时，<code>left</code> 即为插入位置</li>\n</ol>\n<p>为什么循环结束时 <code>left</code> 就是答案？因为当循环结束时 <code>left &gt; right</code>，此时 <code>left</code> 指向的位置恰好是第一个大于 <code>target</code> 的元素的位置——这正是 <code>target</code> 应该被插入的位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>target 存在</td>\n<td>在循环中直接返回</td>\n<td>mid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>target &lt; nums[0]</td>\n<td>left 始终不动</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>target &gt; nums[n-1]</td>\n<td>left 最终越界</td>\n<td>n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>target 在两元素之间</td>\n<td>left 停在右侧元素位置</td>\n<td>left</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function searchInsert(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = nums.length - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;    const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] === target) {&#10;      return mid;&#10;    } else if (nums[mid] &lt; target) {&#10;      left = mid + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      right = mid - 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return left;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchInsert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>另一种写法是直接实现 <strong>lower bound</strong>，不单独处理相等的情况：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function searchInsertLowerBound(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = nums.length;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt; right) {&#10;    const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] &lt; target) {&#10;      left = mid + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      right = mid;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return left;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchInsertLowerBound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种左闭右开 <code>[left, right)</code> 的写法更加通用，可以直接复用到 LC #34（查找排序数组的首末位置）等场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>每次迭代将搜索范围缩小一半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用常数个变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最坏比较次数</td>\n<td>⌈log₂(n+1)⌉</td>\n<td>n 个元素的二分查找上界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二分查找是算法中最基础也最容易出错的技巧。边界条件（<code>left &lt;= right</code> vs <code>left &lt; right</code>、<code>right = mid</code> vs <code>right = mid - 1</code>）是主要的易错点。本题建议同时掌握左闭右闭和左闭右开两种写法，并理解各自的循环不变量。本题是 LC #34、LC #69、LC #278 等二分查找变体题的入门基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 35 搜索插入位置","id":"leetcode-35-搜索插入位置"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 27 移除元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0027-remove-element"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 66 加一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0066-plus-one"}}